{"kind":"assert","text":"Disposition of filing request 24611586.\n\nThe J3 follow-up is filed as request 25b40ad2 to the builder, target\nmain, next in order 1ea188be. It covers all four non-blocking points of\napproval c9bd8822: terminal recovery for an empty run directory or a\ncorrupt record, the `claim-too-large` name, combined streams under the\nsupported ctr profile, and the manifest under ruling 4e199bd8.\n\nRecovery policy: a directory without a readable claim, older than a\nconfigured grace bound, and any corrupt record end the job `run-lost`\nwith no execution and the record kept. The service never starts a\nreplacement execution on recovery; a retry is a new job. Inside the\ngrace bound the service waits as today.\n\nRetire this filing request when you have read the disposition. The\nevidence-rules landing 9e313eff is deployed to the three Workers by the\nplanner this hour.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}